                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Incredibly simple visual novel.\n\nDespite the nudity tag, there isn't really anything to see here.\n\nStory is very basic, with choices mostly limited to correct / incorrect paths for obtaining various potion ingredients.\n\nArt is passable for the genre, but there is no voice overs. \n\nBased on my playtime, I recommend getting it discounted, if at all. It's mostly a nice chill distraction game that you can play between bigger, more time-consuming games. There are four endings and none of the achievements are particularly hard to get.",
